{"seq":2,"slug":"rendering-techniques","title":"渲染技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forward-vs-deferred","title":"前向渲染与延迟渲染对比","url":"/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/forward-vs-deferred","wordCount":1389,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"physically-based-rendering","title":"基于物理的渲染（PBR）","url":"/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/physically-based-rendering","wordCount":1567,"readingTime":7},{"seq":3,"slug":"global-illumination-realtime","title":"实时全局光照方案","url":"/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/rendering-techniques/global-illumination-realtime","wordCount":1972,"readingTime":8}],"introMarkdown":"# 渲染技术\n\n本章探讨构建在管线之上的主流渲染策略与光照模型。\n\n第一篇对比前向渲染与延迟渲染两大架构范式，分析各自的适用场景与性能特征。第二篇深入基于物理的渲染（PBR），解释微表面模型、能量守恒与 BRDF 的工程实现。第三篇聚焦实时全局光照，覆盖从屏幕空间方法到辐照度探针、再到最新的神经辐射缓存等方案。\n\n三篇文档体现了渲染技术从「正确绘制单个物体」到「模拟全场景光能传输」的递进关系。每种技术都需要与第一章的管线阶段紧密配合才能高效实现。\n"}